-- the build: every public page made and kept (the paper's page, the front page, every published work
-- and its search item), one after another, so the server answers every public address with kept bytes;
-- then the machine stops (the file's arguments after it are not files to read)
s-make-site : List Word → List Word → Proc W Unit
s-make-site st m = bind (s-paper st m) (λ p → bind (s-site-all st s-published) (λ u → exit #0))
